  "description": "A racist trope is a recurring, often offensive, stereotype or cliché used to demean or stereotype a racial or ethnic group. The 'monkey blood' meme is a modern example of a racist trope that uses graphic imagery and text to reinforce the false and harmful idea that Black people are violent, animalistic, or inferior.",
